     "id": "0e7cb690",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">“To create engaging content for an international brand to be displayed in BCF Stores nationwide.”</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">We used our local Sunny Coast knowledge to help Zempire scout the perfect location to showcase their epic camping gear.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">We helped the Zempire team feel at ease and supplied them with all the luxuries you would find in a typical studio, thanks to our 4×4 Production Van fully equipped with a change room, makeup station and some much-needed shade. Our producer also doubled as a barista providing full-service coffees, snacks, and bottled water.</p>",
      "text_color": "#55575C",
      "typography_typography": "custom",
      "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
