    {
     "id": "0f742e98",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">“We were hugely impressed by the Pepper team, from the start of the collaboration to the finish they we absolutely awesome. We ended up picking them over other companies because from the initial contact, they went above and beyond with location suggestions, info and ways to bring our content to life.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">They were professional, prompt and reliable with their comms and super easy to work with on shoot day. They were really patient to ensure we were getting the best shots possible and brought a really good vibe to the shoot which made it easy for our talent to come across really genuine.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">10/10 for Pepper, couldn’t recommend them enough and they will be our go-to for future shoots on the Sunshine Coast. Thanks again team!”</p>",
      "text_color": "#55575C",
      "typography_typography": "custom",
      "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
      "typography_font_size": {
       "unit": "px",
